<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">International Education Week (IEW) celebrates the benefits of international education and exchange worldwide. Students are eager for global education, but their motivations are changing. Flywire commissioned a study with 1,800+ students from 9 countries to better understand their attitudes and experiences of pursuing and paying for higher education.&nbsp;</p> </td> 
