<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">After using Flywire’s flagship international payments solution for almost a decade, Wayne State implemented its collections offering in 2019. Flywire’s past-due receivables technology helped the institution to automate, streamline and track collector actions.</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"> Learn more about Wayne State University and how Flywire helped the university collect millions that were past due.</span></p> </td> 
